{"id":"5f75a3c8d7a1c91d","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow.md","title":"Definition — Sheafification Universal Arrow","display":"Definition — Sheafification Universal Arrow","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow","aliases":["14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow"],"display":"Definition — Sheafification Universal Arrow","depends_on":["[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-sheafification-universal-arrow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Sheafification Universal Arrow"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为预层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\">\\(i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a> 的满子范畴包含函子。自然变换和垂直复合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafification}(A,\\eta,F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,F,i(A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\ \\forall\\phi\\\n(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\phi,F,i(G))\\to\\exists!\\bar\\phi\\\n(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\bar\\phi,A,G)\\land i(\\bar\\phi)\\circ\\eta=\\phi)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafification}(A,\\eta,F,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,F,i(A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall G\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\ \\forall\\phi\\\n(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\phi,F,i(G))\\to\\exists!\\bar\\phi\\\n(\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\bar\\phi,A,G)\\land i(\\bar\\phi)\\circ\\eta=\\phi)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 The Associated Sheaf Functor，印刷页 128–133。对象层化和函子层化分开：本条定义泛箭头；函子在箭头上的作用须由普遍性质唯一诱导，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a>。存在性由双 plus 构造实现，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5f5c83c7517a2504\" href=\"?note=5f5c83c7517a2504\" title=\"14-thm-double-plus-sheafification\">14-thm-double-plus-sheafification</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$F$ 为预层。$i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 是 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]] 的满子范畴包含函子。自然变换和垂直复合见 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]、[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$F$ 为预层。$i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 是 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]] 的满子范畴包含函子。自然变换和垂直复合见 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]、[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$F$ 为预层。$i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 是 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]] 的满子范畴包含函子。自然变换和垂直复合见 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]、[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书定位：III.5 The Associated Sheaf Functor，印刷页 128–133。对象层化和函子层化分开：本条定义泛箭头；函子在箭头上的作用须由普遍性质唯一诱导，见 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]。存在性由双 plus 构造实现，见 [[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-double-plus-sheafification","status":"resolved","id":"5f5c83c7517a2504","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书定位：III.5 The Associated Sheaf Functor，印刷页 128–133。对象层化和函子层化分开：本条定义泛箭头；函子在箭头上的作用须由普遍性质唯一诱导，见 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]。存在性由双 plus 构造实现，见 [[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"i:\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\widehat{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{align